get.description:
Returns the patient's SHA benefit interventions. The optional filters below narrow the results;
omit them to return all of the patient's benefit interventions.

**Related documentation:** [Interventions Coverage](/docs/claims/process/eligibility/interventionsCoverage), [Benefit Matrix](/docs/claims/guides/benefit-matrix), [Understanding Benefits and Intervention Codes](/docs/claims/guides/benefit-intervention-codes)
